{"title":"Career roadmap · Extension Worker","role":"Extension Worker","summary":"Career alignment: An Extension Worker connects communities with practical knowledge, government programmes, NGOs, research institutions, and development services. With a B.Sc in Home Science, the role can focus particularly on family and community welfare, nutrition, health awareness, women and child development, livelihood skills, sanitation, financial literacy, food and household management, and community education.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a people-oriented career requiring a combination of Home Science + communication + community mobilisation + programme implementation + documentation + basic data analysis."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical role","Main focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Home Science Student"},{"text":"Human development + community studies"}],[{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Community/Extension Intern"},{"text":"Field exposure"}],[{"text":"Graduate"},{"text":"Extension Worker / Community Facilitator"},{"text":"Community programmes"}],[{"text":"2–4 years"},{"text":"Extension Officer / Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"Programme implementation"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Senior Extension / Community Development Officer"},{"text":"Programme management"}],[{"text":"7–10+ years"},{"text":"Project Manager / Development Professional"},{"text":"Large-scale programmes"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Programme Director / Development Specialist"},{"text":"Policy, strategy and leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Home Science foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge across the major Home Science domains."},{"type":"h","text":"Human development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human growth and development"},{"text":"Child development"},{"text":"Family studies"},{"text":"Psychology"},{"text":"Sociology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human nutrition"},{"text":"Food science"},{"text":"Community nutrition"},{"text":"Nutritional deficiencies"},{"text":"Food safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Household and community"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resource management"},{"text":"Family resource management"},{"text":"Consumer education"},{"text":"Community living"},{"text":"Household economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Start developing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"public speaking"},{"text":"interpersonal communication"},{"text":"presentation"},{"text":"group discussion"},{"text":"community education"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Community development + extension"},{"type":"p","text":"Begin specialising toward extension work."},{"type":"h","text":"Community development"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"rural development"},{"text":"urban community development"},{"text":"social development"},{"text":"community organisation"},{"text":"participatory development"},{"text":"local institutions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Extension education"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"extension methods"},{"text":"adult education"},{"text":"community mobilisation"},{"text":"needs assessment"},{"text":"behaviour-change communication"},{"text":"awareness campaigns"},{"text":"training methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication methods"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to conduct:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"community meetings"},{"text":"workshops"},{"text":"demonstrations"},{"text":"awareness programmes"},{"text":"household visits"},{"text":"focus-group discussions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Field implementation"},{"type":"p","text":"The final stage should become strongly practical."},{"type":"h","text":"Programme planning"},{"type":"p","text":"L