th programmes"},{"text":"agricultural extension projects"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"CSR foundations"},{"text":"international development organisations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Specific job titles and eligibility vary by organisation."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise practical development skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Extension"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Extension education"},{"text":"Community mobilisation"},{"text":"Adult learning"},{"text":"Behaviour-change communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rural development"},{"text":"Women and child development"},{"text":"Livelihood development"},{"text":"Public health"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Survey methodology"},{"text":"Research methods"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Monitoring & evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Data collection tools"},{"text":"GIS basics"},{"text":"Dashboarding"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful field-data tools to learn include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KoboToolbox"},{"text":"ODK"},{"text":"SurveyCTO"}]}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Sc + field experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Extension Worker"},{"text":"Community Worker"},{"text":"Community Facilitator"},{"text":"Field Coordinator"},{"text":"Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Development Associate"},{"text":"Community Mobiliser"},{"text":"Social Work Assistant"},{"text":"Project Assistant"},{"text":"Outreach Coordinator"}]},{"type":"p","text":"With experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Extension Officer"},{"text":"Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"Community Development Officer"},{"text":"Livelihood Coordinator"},{"text":"Programme Officer"},{"text":"Monitoring & Evaluation Associate"},{"text":"Development Consultant"},{"text":"Project Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What employers may test"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"You may be assessed on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"public speaking"},{"text":"community interaction"},{"text":"presentation"},{"text":"active listening"},{"text":"conflict handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Community development"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"community participation"},{"text":"needs assessment"},{"text":"social mobilisation"},{"text":"inclusion"},{"text":"stakeholder engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Extension"},{"type":"p","text":"Know:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"extension methods"},{"text":"adult education"},{"text":"demonstrations"},{"text":"training programmes"},{"text":"behaviour-change communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Field research"},{"type":"p","text":"Be familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"questionnaires"},{"text":"interviews"},{"text":"focus groups"},{"text":"sampling"},{"text":"field observation"},{"text":"data collection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programme management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Planning","Implementation","Monitoring","Evaluation","Reporting"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree can open more specialised development roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant programmes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Home Science"},{"text":"M.Sc Extension Education"},{"text":"M.Sc Community Science"},{"text":"M.A. Rural Development"},{"text":"M.A. Sociology"},{"text":"M.A. Social Work"},{"text":"M.A. Development Studies"},{"text":"Master of Public Health"},{"text":"M.A. Women Studies"},{"text":"M.A. Development Communication"},{"text":"M.B.A. Social / Rural Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best pathway for extension"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Home Science","M.Sc Extension Education / Community Science","Field Experience","Extension Officer / Programme Coordinator","Senior Development Professional"]}]},{"heading":"Government career pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the specific recruitment system and eligibility, graduates can explore roles connected to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"women and child development"},{"text":"rural development"},{"text":"social welfare"},{"text":"community health"},{"text":"skill development"},{"text":"agricultural/community programmes"},{"text":"government outreach programmes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Some government positions require specific degrees, competitive examinations, experience, or professional qualifications."},{"type":"p","text":"Always verify the current recruitment notification for the exact post."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Community Development"},{"text":"Development Studies"},{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"International Development"},{"text":"Social Policy"},{"text":"Rural Development"},{"text":"Social Work"},{"text":"Public Administration"},{"text":"Humanitarian Studies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"New Zealand"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international development careers, combining a development degree with monitoring & evaluation, public health, data analysis, or programme management can be particularly useful."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"NGO/development pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Home Science","Community / Extension Intern","Extension Worker / Field Coordinator","Programme Officer","Senior Programme Officer","Project Manager","Programme Manager","Programme Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Government/community pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc","Extension / Community Worker","Extension Officer","Senior Development Officer","District / Programme-level role","State / Regional Programme Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual government progression depends on the specific service/cadre and recruitment route."},{"type":"h","text":"PhD / research directions"},{"type":"p","text":"For research-oriented students:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Community development"},{"text":"Extension education"},{"text":"Development communication"},{"text":"Women empowerment"},{"text":"Rural livelihoods"},{"text":"Child development"},{"text":"Community nutrition"},{"text":"Public health"},{"text":"Behaviour-change interventions"},{"text":"Digital extension"},{"text":"Social innovation"},{"text":"Programme evaluation"},{"text":"Development policy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 career evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Community extension work is likely to become increasingly digital and data-driven."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Digital extension"},{"type":"p","text":"Community workers will increasingly use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"mobile applications"},{"text":"WhatsApp/community platforms"},{"text":"digital learning"},{"text":"teleconsultation"},{"text":"online training"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Data-driven programmes"},{"type":"p","text":"Field teams will increasingly use:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Survey Data","GIS","Dashboards","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"to identify communities requiring targeted interventions."},{"type":"h","text":"3. AI-assisted community services"},{"type":"p","text":"AI may support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"multilingual communication"},{"text":"personalised learning"},{"text":"beneficiary information"},{"text":"programme monitoring"},{"text":"translation"},{"text":"field-data analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human interaction will remain critical because community development involves trust, culture, social relationships and local context."},{"type":"h","text":"4. GIS-enabled extension"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS can help organisations understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"programme coverage"},{"text":"underserved communities"},{"text":"infrastructure gaps"},{"text":"health/nutrition patterns"},{"text":"service accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Impact measurement"},{"type":"p","text":"Development organisations will increasingly demand measurable outcomes rather than simply reporting the number of activities conducted."},{"type":"p","text":"The future profile will therefore be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Community Professional","Programme Manager","Data/Impact Specialist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Home Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Human Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"Food Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Family Studies"},{"type":"p","text":"Resource Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Community Science"},{"type":"h","text":"Extension"},{"type":"p","text":"Extension Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Community Mobilisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Adult Education"},{"type":"p","text":"Training & Facilitation"},{"type":"p","text":"Behaviour-Change Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Field research"},{"type":"p","text":"Survey Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Interviews"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus Groups"},{"type":"p","text":"Sampling"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Collection"},{"type":"p","text":"Field Observation"},{"type":"h","text":"Programme management"},{"type":"p","text":"Programme Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Implementation"},{"type":"p","text":"Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluation"},{"type":"p","text":"Reporting"},{"type":"p","text":"Stakeholder Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"PowerPoint"},{"type":"p","text":"KoboToolbox"},{"type":"p","text":"ODK"},{"type":"p","text":"GIS Basics"},{"type":"p","text":"Dashboards"},{"type":"p","te